  "goodToKnow": "Die Sitte is a custom: Das ist hier so Sitte, and the proverb Andere Länder, andere Sitten (other countries, other customs). In the plural, Sitten also means morals or manners: Was sind denn das für Sitten? (what kind of behaviour is that?). In law, a sittenwidrig contract (contrary to public morals) is void. Die Sitte was also the old name for the vice squad. Plural: die Sitten."
